macro printdeck [1]=-
* -------------------------------------------------------
* This macro is designed to print patch/decks on PC via
* Microsoft WORD with 2 columns, font New Curier, 7 pitch,
* condensed
* -------------------------------------------------------

if [1] <> '-' then
 cd [1]
 cd ..
 clist [1].txt -A 70 [1]
endif

 mess  ------------------------------------------------
 mess File [1].txt is ready to print with MS Word
 mess You may set the following options:
 mess  1. 2 columns
 mess  2. Font 'New Courier' x 7 pitch, condensed
 mess  3. Margins: Top   - 1.3 cm, bottom, left = 0.5 cm
 mess              right - 0.5 cm
 mess  4. Landscape orientation
 mess  5. Do not forget to replace all 'Page break' with
 mess     'Column Break'
 mess  ------------------------------------------------

return
